        },
        "quote": "(c) Notwithstanding the prohibition in subsection (a) of this section, it shall be lawful to kill wild or undomesticated migratory birds, game birds and turkeys by shotgun provided the hunting is done on Kansas Department of Wildlife, Parks and Tourism (KDWPT) owned or managed property during the hunting season by an individual participating in a mentor-youth hunting program administered by KDWPT to whom KDWPT has issued a hunting license, hunting permit and special access permit for that specific tract of land. (Ord. 20106 § 11, 12-19-17.)",
